  dialogueLines:
  - Good evening. I'm Mr. Jeremy, from the Worm Welfare Bureau.
  - We've received... an anonymous tip about a worm in this residence.
  - Just a routine check. Nothing to worry about. Probably.
  - Would you mind if I took a look at him?
  - Interesting. Very interesting.
  - Just a peek. For the file.
  - Hm. I see.
  - Well. That will be all for now.
  - We'll be in touch.
